[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5160693543","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122005#issuecomment-5160693543","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122005","id":5160693543,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABM5nvJw","user":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-02T22:41:59Z","updated_at":"2026-08-02T22:41:59Z","body":"Also reproducible on 4.6 and 4.8 dev 2.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5160693543/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5399962640","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122005#issuecomment-5399962640","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122005","id":5399962640,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQdzkEA","user":{"login":"reluctantmedia","id":16323821,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzIzODIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16323821?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reluctantmedia","html_url":"https://github.com/reluctantmedia","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reluctantmedia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reluctantmedia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reluctantmedia/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reluctantmedia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reluctantmedia/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reluctantmedia/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reluctantmedia/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reluctantmedia/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reluctantmedia/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-24T19:02:58Z","updated_at":"2026-08-24T19:02:58Z","body":"Thanks for looking into this! It saved me a lot of time and heartache. In my case the fix in #122006 wasn't sufficient and I also had to add an extra line to also trigger the dependency changed notification on userdata mismatch (as well as when enabling motion vectors):\n\n```\n\tif (userdata_count != particles->userdata_count) {\n\t\t// Mismatch userdata, re-create all buffers.\n\t\t_particles_free_data(particles);\n\t\tonly_instances_changed = true; // THIS FIXES IT FOR ME\n\t} else if (enable_motion_vectors) {\n```\nI could create a PR if this looks legit? Although I'm not sure how to create a MRP since this seems to be some kind of race condition which I only see in scenes with a lot of other stuff going on, it's not 100% reproduceable. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5399962640/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5470814930","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122005#issuecomment-5470814930","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122005","id":5470814930,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRhYC0g","user":{"login":"AxelStrem","id":11349690,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzQ5Njkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11349690?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AxelStrem","html_url":"https://github.com/AxelStrem","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AxelStrem/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AxelStrem/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AxelStrem/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AxelStrem/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AxelStrem/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AxelStrem/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AxelStrem/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AxelStrem/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AxelStrem/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-30T19:35:09Z","updated_at":"2026-08-30T19:55:02Z","body":"@reluctantmedia I've looked into it and I think there's a genuine second bug, and your fix looks legit: in my project, the uniform set was getting freed from the inline `update_particles()` inside of `_geometry_instance_update()`; that's what my reordering fix covered.  \nBut there's also a global `update_particles()` call at `rendering_server_default.cpp:103`, and that can also trigger the free. That's probably what happens in your project.  \n\n  I've investigated it a little and I think your fix is legit, although there are probably some minor things to consider, e.g.:\n - the flag name `only_instances_changed` will not match what the flag actually does after the fix\n - there is also a comment at notify site  about the \"element that has been changed because motion vectors were enabled\", that goes stale as well\n - this fix works via `DEPENDENCY_CHANGED_PARTICLES_INSTANCES` notification; arguably `DEPENDENCY_CHANGED_PARTICLES` is the more honest notification for the userdata case.\n\n  Those are just some things I've noticed, either way I think you can create a separate issue if you have an MRP (my MRP probably can be adapted to force a userdata mismatch from the global path, I can try to do that if you want) and then you can create a PR.  \nI didn't run anything, just looked at the code, so I might have missed something.\n\nUpdate: this issue is now reopened so I guess we can just reuse it; let me know if you'd like me to try to adapt the MRP\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5470814930/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5522318718","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122005#issuecomment-5522318718","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122005","id":5522318718,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSSflfg","user":{"login":"reluctantmedia","id":16323821,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzIzODIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16323821?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reluctantmedia","html_url":"https://github.com/reluctantmedia","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reluctantmedia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reluctantmedia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reluctantmedia/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reluctantmedia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reluctantmedia/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reluctantmedia/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reluctantmedia/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reluctantmedia/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reluctantmedia/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-03T07:41:29Z","updated_at":"2026-09-03T07:41:29Z","body":"@AxelStrem yeah I think that would make sense if that's OK, thanks a lot!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5522318718/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5582678600","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122005#issuecomment-5582678600","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122005","id":5582678600,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABTMDqSA","user":{"login":"AxelStrem","id":11349690,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzQ5Njkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11349690?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AxelStrem","html_url":"https://github.com/AxelStrem","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AxelStrem/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AxelStrem/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AxelStrem/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AxelStrem/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AxelStrem/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AxelStrem/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AxelStrem/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AxelStrem/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AxelStrem/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-08T09:28:25Z","updated_at":"2026-09-08T09:28:25Z","body":"@reluctantmedia alright here's what I came up with:\n\n[particles_mrp2.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/31948222/particles_mrp2.zip)\n\nThe way it works is it dynamically updates the process shader code, forcing different `userdata_count` values without triggering `_particles_update_buffers()`. Again, very contrived but it reliably forces the free in the global once-per-frame `update_particles()` which is what I suspect happens in your project.  \n\nI've tested it in 4.8.dev and 4.7, and also that your fix covers it.\n\nI've only tested Forward+ but the same logic applies to Mobile, so your PR should cover both I think; also there's the considerations that I've mentioned regarding the best way to fix this. \n\nAnyway, best of luck with your PR :)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5582678600/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]